{%- comment -%}
  Region index for the state directory pages. One row per region:
    page-handle|Display name|gym count|region code|country
  Single source of truth mapping a /pages/bjj-schools-* handle to its region.
  Keep alphabetical by display name.

  The count column is DISPLAY ONLY — it feeds the "Find schools in another state"
  nav list. Each page computes its own gym_count from the data.

  !! WHEN AUDITING A PAGE'S COUNT, DO NOT REGEX THE WHOLE HTML FOR !!
  !! /(\d+) BJJ gyms and academies/ — THAT MATCHES THE META DESCRIPTION IN <head> !!
  The SEO description_tag metafield is hand-written and goes stale.
  Trust instead, in order: the JSON-LD "numberOfItems", the count of class="tjjm-gym"
  cards, or the body paragraph <p class="tjjm-p">N BJJ gyms and academies across M cit.
  These three agree on every page. Verified total across all 61 regions: 5,205.
{%- endcomment -%}
